{
  "Items.GooArmor.Desc": "A shining suit of platemail that is more than just that--it houses the goo-girl, Valeria! Together, they provide excellent protection, but you better be okay with having her handle your private parts when wearing this."
  "Items.GooArmor.Long": "Valeria, the goo-girl armor"
  "Items.GooArmor.RemoveText": "Valeria picks herself up and huffs, [say: Maybe we can adventure some more later on?] before undulating off towards your camp."
  "Items.GooArmor.Short": "Valeria Armor"
  "Items.GooArmor.UseText": "With an ecstatic smile, the goo-armor jumps to her feet and throws her arms around your shoulders. [say: Oh, this is going to be so much fun!] You remind her she is supposed to be your armor, and awkwardly clamber into the wet, squishy platemail. Eventually the two of you get situated, her goo settling around your body and encasing your loins."
}
